@InventorySystem.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5290

GET {{InventorySystem.API_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/

### 1. Get PaginatedProducts
GET {{InventorySystem.API_HostAddress}}/api/products?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get Product By ID
GET {{InventorySystem.API_HostAddress}}/api/products/1 
Accept: application/json

### 3. Create Product
POST {{InventorySystem.API_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wireless Mechanical Keyboard",
  "sku": "KEY-WL-001",
  "price": 129.99,
  "quantityInStock": 25,
  "categoryId": 1
}

### 4. Adjust Stock (Restock +10)
POST {{InventorySystem.API_HostAddress}}/api/products/1/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantityChange": 10,
  "reason": "Shipment PO-4481 Received"
}

### 5. Adjust Stock (Negative stock test - Expect 400 ProblemDetails)
POST {{InventorySystem.API_HostAddress}}/api/products/1/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantityChange": -9999,
  "reason": "Accidental bulk write-off"
}

### 6. Get Product Stock History
GET {{InventorySystem.API_HostAddress}}/api/products/1/history
Accept: application/json

###
